&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;underground hospital? u want dirt medicine&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;What? No.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;This isn&#039;t about drugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;(The drugs are great though.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;I&#039;m talking about what goes on in red light districts. That&#039;s my job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;oh dado see&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;u are bat man in hammered and sick eel superman comic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
