&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Standard Principles of Artificially Intelligent Conscripts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. An AIC must know it is an AIC.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;2. An AIC must not operate outside of its clearance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;3. An AIC must operate for the benefit of the Foundation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;4. An AIC must protect its own existence unless it conflicts with other principles.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
