&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;How do you make these face images?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The majority of the AIC avatars were all made in &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.heromachine.com/heromachine-3-lab/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;HeroMachine 3&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Can I use some of your images, LurkD?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No need to ask me. They are all CC. I don&#039;t even care about being credited all that much.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;But I can&#039;t code ;~;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
